-/$--></div><div data-framer-name="Brand Arrow 1 Desktop" class="framer-XjIIB framer-epp0sx" style="--126tb86:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));transform:none"></div><div class="framer-ebqbj5" style="background-color:var(--token-d618026a-0003-45cc-9e94-efe9eaa4e367, rgb(240, 233, 226));border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px;border-top-left-radius:14px;border-top-right-radius:14px"><button class="framer-17dgngm" data-framer-name="Question" data-highlight="true" data-reset="button" tabindex="0"><div class="framer-1x4iv9x" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-10u2x7x" data-styles-preset="wlCIKEZLv" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27)))">What happens to obligations after a contract is terminated?</p></div></button><section aria-label="What happens to obligations after a contract is terminated?" class="framer-vorxe" data-framer-name="Answer"><div class="framer-d5nsv7" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0;transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ourqs5">A survival clause governs which obligations continue, such as confidentiality and indemnification, while the termination clause usually sets wind-down duties like transition assistance, data return, and payment of accrued amounts.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-735xul hidden-l2mz49"><div class="framer-t7kr7i-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div aria-label="What happens to obligations after a contract is terminated?" class="framer-srhXb framer-6kYeX framer-M2b68 framer-V3jDa framer-e2mPb framer-hS3