en-2n9j1k"><div class="framer-t7kr7i-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div aria-label="Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?" class="framer-srhXb framer-6kYeX framer-M2b68 framer-V3jDa framer-e2mPb framer-hS3Il framer-fEPRh framer-Nkh3d framer-pkSlA framer-Jdu9s framer-nX8fo framer-pHUDq framer-AJX3g framer-KQWSO framer-r9k1us framer-v-cvrp5h" data-framer-name="Closed" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-u3b11p-container"><!--$--><div></div><!--/$--></div><div data-framer-name="Brand Arrow 1 Desktop" class="framer-XjIIB framer-epp0sx" style="--126tb86:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));transform:none"></div><div class="framer-ebqbj5" style="background-color:var(--token-d618026a-0003-45cc-9e94-efe9eaa4e367, rgb(240, 233, 226));border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px;border-top-left-radius:14px;border-top-right-radius:14px"><button class="framer-17dgngm" data-framer-name="Question" data-highlight="true" data-reset="button" tabindex="0"><div class="framer-1x4iv9x" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-10u2x7x" data-styles-preset="wlCIKEZLv" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27)))">Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?</p></div></button><section aria-label="Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?" class="framer-vorxe" data-framer-name="Answer"><div class="framer-d5nsv7" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0;transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ourqs5">Sometimes, under common-law principles such as material breach, but without a clause the grounds and process are uncertain. An express termination clause is the safer way to define the exits.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-735xul hidden-l2mz49"><div class="framer-t7kr7i-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div aria-label="Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?" class="framer-srhXb framer-6kYeX framer-M2b68 framer-V3jDa framer-e2mPb framer-hS3Il framer-fEPRh framer-Nkh3d framer-pkSlA framer-Jdu9s framer-nX8fo framer-pHUDq framer-AJX3g framer-KQWSO framer-r9k1us framer-v-cvrp5h" data-framer-name="Closed" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-u3b11p-container"><!--$--><div></div><!--/$--></div><div data-framer-name="Brand Arrow 2 Mobile" class="framer-XjIIB framer-5g93j6" style="--126tb86:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));transform:none"></div><div class="framer-ebqbj5" style="background-color:var(--token-d618026a-0003-45cc-9e94-efe9eaa4e367, rgb(240, 233, 226));border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px;border-top-left-radius:14px;border-top-right-radius:14px"><button class="framer-17dgngm" data-framer-name="Question" data-highlight="true" data-reset="button" tabindex="0"><div class="framer-1x4iv9x" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-10u2x7x" data-styles-preset="wlCIKEZLv" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27)))">Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?</p></div></button><section aria-label="Can a contract be terminated without a termination clause?" class="framer-vorxe" data-framer-name="Answer"><div class="framer-d5nsv7" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0;transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ourqs5">Sometimes, under common-law principles such as material breach, but without a clause the grounds and process are uncertain. An express termination clause is the safer way to define the exits.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div></div><div class="framer-7xmb7y"><div class="ssr-variant hidden-18tje9j hidden-2n9j1k"><div class="framer-t7kr7i-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div aria-label="Does termination for convenience require a reason?" class="framer-srhXb framer-6kYeX framer-M2b68 framer-V3jDa framer-e2mPb framer-hS3Il framer-fEPRh framer-Nkh3d framer-pkSlA framer-Jdu9s framer-nX8fo framer-pHUDq framer-AJX3g framer-KQWSO framer-r9k1us framer-v-cvrp5h" data-framer-name="Closed" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-u3b11p-container"><!--$--><div></div><!--/$--></div><div data-framer-name="Brand Arrow 1 Desktop" class="framer-XjIIB framer-epp0sx" style="--126tb86:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));transform:none"></div><div class="framer-ebqbj5" style="background-color:var(--token-d618026a-0003-45cc-9e94-efe9eaa4e367, rgb(240, 233, 226));border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px;border-top-left-radius:14px;border-top-right-radius:14px"><button class="framer-17dgngm" data-framer-name="Question" data-highlight="true" data-reset="button" tabindex="0"><div class="framer-1x4iv9x" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-10u2x7x" data-styles-preset="wlCIKEZLv" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27)))">Does termination for convenience require a reason?</p></div></button><section aria-label="Does termination for convenience require a reason?" class="framer-vorxe" data-framer-name="Answer"><div class="framer-d5nsv7" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="opacity:0;transform:none"><p dir="auto" class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1ourqs5">No. A termination-for-convenience provision lets a party end the contract without cause or justification, provided it gives the required notice and meets any associated conditions, such as an early-termination fee.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class="ssr-variant hidden-735xul hidden-l2mz49"><div class="framer-t7kr7i-container" style="will-change:transform;opacity:0;transform:translateY(30px)"><div aria-label="Does termination for convenience require a reason?" class="framer-srhXb framer-6kYeX framer-M2b68 framer-V3jDa framer-e2mPb framer-hS3Il framer-fEPRh framer-Nkh3d framer-pkSlA framer-Jdu9s framer-nX8fo framer-pHUDq framer-AJX3g framer-KQWSO framer-r9k1us framer-v-cvrp5h" data-framer-name="Closed" style="width:100%"><div class="framer-u3b11p-container"><!--$--><div></div><!--/$--></div><div data-framer-name="Brand Arrow 2 Mobile" class="framer-XjIIB framer-5g93j6" style="--126tb86:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));transform:none"></div><div class="framer-ebqbj5" style="background-color:var(--token-d618026a-0003-45cc-9e94-efe9eaa4e367, rgb(240, 233, 226));border-bottom-left-radius:14px;border-bottom-right-radius:14px;border-top-left-radius:14px;border-top-right-radius:14px"><button class="framer-17dgngm" data-framer-name="Question" data-highlight="true" data-reset="button" tabindex="0"><div class="framer-1x4iv9x" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dd733a14-2c31-4838-925e-cfaa63433040, rgb(5, 21, 27));--framer-link-text-color:rgb(0, 153, 255);--framer-link-text-decoration:underline;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset